    <!-- Intentionally empty.

         This changelog previously added CA_REQUEST_MODEL / PK_REQUEST_MODEL to
         IGA_SERVER_CERT_DRAFT, to carry the enclave-approved ServerCert:1 CA and public-key
         sub-model carriers alongside the leaf on the parent CR's REQUEST_MODEL.

         ResourceIdentity:1 replaced that three-carrier ceremony with a single carrier — the ORK
         builds every TBSCertificate itself and returns three signatures from one request — so both
         columns are gone. The changeset was removed rather than paired with a dropColumn because
         the server-identity feature has not shipped; see the same call on IGA_SERVER_CERT_DRAFT's
         SPIFFE_ID / INSTANCE_ID columns in iga-changelog-1.5.0.xml.

         The file and its <include> in iga-changelog-master.xml are retained so the changelog
         numbering stays contiguous. -->

</databaseChangeLog>
